<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 30-3 CHASING FIRST INNINGS 181.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 30-3 CHASING FIRST INNINGS 181.</headline>
<dateline>WANGANUI, New Zealand 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, chasing a first innings target of 181, were 30 for three wickets at close of play on Thursday on the first day of their four-day tour match against New Zealand A.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand A first innings 181 (D. Murray 49, M. Horne 64, C. Silverwood 6-44)</p>
<p>England first innings 30-3.</p>
</text>
